CSV and TSV
description: text/csv, text/tab-separated-values - a scrollable grid
- >
  A `.csv` or `.tsv` file renders as a table - header row, scrollable grid - on its own page
  and inline as a chapter chunk. It stays a foreign text file: for a table that is yamlover
  DATA (editable cells, merges, pointers), use the native
  [table document](*::documents:marklower:tables).
